  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": 1,
  "section_notes": "S2 removes any numerical failure-rate ceiling and any sales stop, which mainly protects Northwind's Hearth 10 (6.2%), while customers still get full per-model results. S5 makes recall mandatory at 8 per 100k, which catches Halcyon's Ember 8 (9.9), but recall is defined as notification plus remedy without an automatic sales ban. S1 requires 24-hour reporting of all thermal incidents regardless of confirmed cause, which burdens both companies' unreported incidents equally."
